 * EndpointMeta 涓婄殑 pathname/pathParams/queryParams/bodyFields/authType 瀛楁銆俓n *
 * 瑕嗙洊鑼冨洿锛歕n * - normalizePath锛氭暟瀛?ID / UUID / 闀?hex / 鏅€氱墖娈礬n * - inferType锛歴tring/number/boolean/object/array/null
