// Legacy HTTP-replay exports (REMOVED in 鈶?
// ====================================================================
// 鈶? removed because the HTTP-replay approach cannot work for any of the
// 3 built-in providers (T1 2026-06-04). See CHANGELOG 鈶?for details.
//   - parseSseFrames
